WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.716
Gersten's conjecture for one-relator groups.

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:06.278
Baumslag Solitar subgroups block hyperbolicity. Gersten said

3
00:00:06.278 --> 00:00:08.830
they are the only obstruction here.

4
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:13.225
Climb the hierarchy one step at a time; each step keeps hyperbolicity.

5
00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:17.310
Claimed: no such subgroup means hyperbolic.

6
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:18.844
Not in Lean.
